+### Laguna-XS-2.1 (`laguna` plain MoE, 18.9 GB, ~2× host RAM)
+
+The matrix's first NON-hybrid. Upstream classifies `laguna` as a plain-transformer MoE
+(verified in `llama-arch.cpp`), and every difference below follows from that.
+
+**Recommended recipe (single-shot / cold sessions):**
+
+```bash
