+off: this template renders history reasoning natively, so the echo rewrite is redundant
+and actually COSTS a 252-fresh reconcile turn (T2: 44 s) before its decode-side T3 win.
+`--rs-seq` is not applicable (free partial chops without it: c4 reused 55 tokens with
+rs-seq OFF; c5 ≡ c4). Reasoning-heavy note: the 192/256-token budgets truncated think
+spans (measured FAIL, then pass at 384); the honest lever today is the request's
+`max_tokens`.
